    'UES picks up used oil, filters, antifreeze and oily water from more than 35,000 businesses and re-refines the oil into new base oil at its own plant in Peachtree City, Georgia. Its customers are shop owners and fleet managers who care about two things: <strong>will someone actually show up, and will the paperwork hold up if an inspector asks</strong>. The old homepage answered neither quickly. I rebuilt it so both answers are on screen within the first scroll.',
